        ui_data: dict | None = None,
        format: str = "txt",
    ) -> dict:
        """
        Export definitie via UI service.

        Args:
            definition_id: ID van definitie om te exporteren
            ui_data: UI data zoals voorbeelden, review, etc.
            format: Export formaat

        Returns:
            Export resultaat dict
        """
